# Riding close alongside a trail (the frame rate fell to ~35 there, 2026-11-01). Ride north 8 s,
# U-turn by double tap: back south ~50 units beside it. The cpu figure is a one-second average:
# shots 2.5 s and more into the run alongside. Then away from it, for comparison.
wait_boot # the opening flight is up
skip_prologue # straight to play, the cycle at its start
wait 1.4
wait 8
shot along_0_before
press left
press left
wait 2.5
shot along_1
wait 1
shot along_2
wait 1
shot along_3
press right
wait 3
shot along_4_away
